    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44074" root="&#xA;                        نفع&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَعَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>It profited him; availed him; was of
use</i> or <i>benefit,</i> or <i>was useful</i> or <i>beneficial, to him.</i>
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَعَهُ مِنْهُ</span>: see an ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَدٌّ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَنْفَعُ لِكَذَا</span>,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ كَذَا</span>, <i>It</i> (a medicine) <i>is good, beneficial,</i>
or <i>profitable, as a remedy, for,</i> or <i>against, such
a thing,</i> meaning such a disease or the like.

